{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-p033a","title":"曹丕援让国故事辞受命","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-p033a-account","label":"裴注·献帝传","text":"曹丕援让国故事辞受命","evidence":["wendi-e-p033a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"答令","evidence":["wendi-e-p033a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年受禅前","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年受禅前"},"evidence":["wendi-e-p033a-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-p033a-q","source_order":[2,146,"P033a"],"order":521}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-p033a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-3e764af564fa6e520f3e","layer":"pei","quote":"令曰：“世之所不足者，道义也；所有余者，苟妄也。常人之性，贱所不足，贵所有余；故曰‘不患无位，患所以立’。孤虽寡德，庶自免于常人之贵。夫‘石可破而不可夺坚，丹可磨而不可夺赤’。丹石微物，尚保斯质；况吾托士人之末列，曾受教于君子哉？且于陵仲子以仁当富，柏成子高以义为贵；鲍焦感子贡之言，弃其蔬而槁死；薪者讥季札失辞，皆委重而弗视。吾独何人？昔周武，大圣也，使叔旦盟胶鬲于四内，使召公约微子于共头。故伯夷、叔齐相与笑之曰：‘昔神农氏之有天下，不以人之坏自成，不以人之卑自高。’以为周之伐殷以暴也。吾德非周武而义惭夷、齐，庶欲远苟妄之失道，立丹石之不夺；迈于陵之所富，蹈柏成之所贵；执鲍焦之贞至，遵薪者之清节。故曰：‘三军可夺帅，匹夫不可夺志。’吾之斯志，岂可夺哉！”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":145,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fc6f9c6942b5c231c294","start":0,"end":331,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
